@eventUrl = http://localhost:8081
@orderUrl = http://localhost:8085
@userId = 10001
@sessionId = 2001
@tierId = 3001

### 1. 查询在售演出
GET {{eventUrl}}/shows

### 2. 查询场次
GET {{eventUrl}}/shows/1001/sessions

### 3. 查询票档余量
GET {{eventUrl}}/shows/sessions/{{sessionId}}/ticket-tiers

### 4. 开售前预热 Redis 余票
PUT {{orderUrl}}/ticket-rush/sessions/{{sessionId}}/tiers/{{tierId}}/stock?stock=5
user-info: {{userId}}

### 5. Lua 原子预扣并异步建单
POST {{orderUrl}}/ticket-rush
Content-Type: application/json
user-info: {{userId}}

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "tierId": {{tierId}},
  "audienceId": 90001,
  "quantity": 1
}

> {% client.global.set("rushRequestId", response.body.replaceAll('"', '')); %}

### 6. 轮询抢票结果；成功格式为 SUCCESS:{orderId}
GET {{orderUrl}}/ticket-rush/{{rushRequestId}}
user-info: {{userId}}

### 7. 普通订单路径（无需 MQ 时可用于演示支付、出票和验票）
POST {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders
Content-Type: application/json
user-info: {{userId}}

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "tierId": {{tierId}},
  "audienceId": 90001,
  "quantity": 1
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body); %}

### 8. 模拟支付成功并出票
PUT {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders/{{orderId}}/pay
user-info: {{userId}}

### 9. 查询电子票；复制返回的 token 赋给下方 ticketToken
GET {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders/{{orderId}}/tickets
user-info: {{userId}}

@ticketToken = replace-with-ticket-token

### 10. 第一次验票应成功
PUT {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders/tickets/{{ticketToken}}/verify
user-info: {{userId}}

### 11. 重复验票应失败
PUT {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders/tickets/{{ticketToken}}/verify
user-info: {{userId}}

### 12. 超限购示例：同用户同场次总数超过 2 时应失败
POST {{orderUrl}}/ticket-orders
Content-Type: application/json
user-info: {{userId}}

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "tierId": {{tierId}},
  "audienceId": 90001,
  "quantity": 3
}
